ggle-link`\n\n---\n\n### 3. Auth Slice / Redux State Management (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/authSlice.ts`)\n\n**User Interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface User {\n  id: string\n  email: string\n  name: string\n  avatar_url: string | null\n  bio: string | null\n  phone: string | null\n  is_host: boolean\n  created_at: string\n}\n\ninterface AuthState {\n  currentUser: User | null\n  loading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n1. `loginUser(email)` - POST to `/api/auth` with email only\n2. `registerUser({name, email})` - POST to `/api/auth` with name and email\n3. `updateUser(id, fields)` - PUT to `/api/users/:id` for profile updates\n4. `becomeHost(userId)` - POST to `/api/users/:id/become-host`\n\n**Actions:**\n- `logout()` - Clears user and error\n- `clearError()` - Clears error message\n\n---\n\n### 4. Test Specification (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`)\n\n**Auth-related test entries:**\n\n**AuthToggle Tests:**\n1. Auth page defaults to login mode\n2. Toggle from login to register mode\n3. Toggle from register back to login mode\n4. Toggle preserves no stale input between modes\n\n**LoginForm Tests:**\n1. Login with valid email redirects to home\n2. Login with empty email shows validation error\n3. Login with invalid email format shows validation error\n4. Login with non-existent email shows error\n5. Login form email input is functional on repeated use\n\n**RegisterForm Tests:**\n1. Register with valid name and email creates account and redirects to home\n2. Register with empty name shows validation error\n3. Register with empty email shows validation error\n4. Register with invalid email format shows validation error\n5. Register with already-existing email shows error\n6. Register form fields are functional on repeated use\n\n**Seed Data for Auth Tests:**\n- Test user: `guest@example.com` (for login tests)\n- Test users in database (created by seed):\n  - `sarah@example.com` (host, is_host=true)\n  - `mike@example.com` (host, is_host=true)\n  - `emma@example.com` (regular user)\n  - `alex@example.com` (regular user)\n\n---\n\n### 5. Netlify Functions (Auth & Users)\n\n#### **Auth Function** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/auth.ts`)\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/auth`\n\n**Login Mode** (email only):\n- Looks up user by email in database\n- Returns 404 with error \"No account found with this email\" if not found\n- Returns 200 with full user object on success\n\n**Register Mode** (email + name):\n- Checks if email already exists\n- Returns 409 with error \"An account with this email already exists\" if duplicate\n- Creates new user with `gen_random_uuid()` for ID\n- Returns 201 with full user object on success\n\n#### **Users Function** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/users.ts`)\n**Endpoints:**\n- `GET /api/users/:id` - Retrieve user by ID\n- `PUT /api/users/:id` - Update user profile (name, bio, phone, avatar_url)\n- `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` - Upgrade user to host\n\n---\n\n### 6. Playwright Configuration (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`)\n\n```typescript\n- Test directory: ./tests\n- Base URL: http://localhost:8888\n- Timeout: 60 seconds\n- Expect timeout: 10 seconds\n- Workers: 1 (sequential execution)\n- Parallel: false\n- Retries: 0\n- Reporter: Replay reporter + JSON + HTML\n- Web server: netlify dev on port 8888\n- Uses Replay Chromium browser\n- Trace on first retry\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Database Schema - Users Table (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/schema.ts`)\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE users (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  email TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  avatar_url TEXT,\n  bio TEXT,\n  phone TEXT,\n  is_host BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT now()\n)\n```\n\n**Key fields for auth:**\n- `id`: UUID primary key (auto-generated)\n- `email`: Unique email for login/registration\n- `name`: User's display name\n- `is_host`: Flag for host status (default false)\n- Nullable fields: `avatar_url`, `bio`, `phone`\n\n---\n\n### 8. Seed Data (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`)\n\n**Auth test users seeded:**\n1. **Sarah Chen** - `sarah@example.com` (host)\n   - ID: `a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`\n   - is_host: true\n\n2. **Mike Johnson** - `mike@example.com` (host)\n   - ID: `a2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222`\n   - is_host: true\n\n3. **Emma Wilson** - `emma@example.com` (guest)\n   - ID: `a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333`\n   - is_host: false\n\n4. **Alex Rivera** - `alex@example.com` (guest)\n   - ID: `a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444`\n   - is_host: false\n\n---\n\n### 9. Shared Components Used by Auth\n\nThe auth system uses these shared/utility patterns:\n- **Redux Toolkit** for state management\n- **React Router** for navigation (`useNavigate`, `Navigate`)\n- **Tailwind CSS** for styling (color tokens: `primary`, `error`, `text`, `bg`)\n- **Redux hooks**: `useDispatch`, `useSelector`\n- **Async thunks** for API communication\n\n---\n\n### 10. API Endpoints Summary\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Purpose | Request Body | Response |\n|--------|----------|---------|--------------|----------|\n| POST | `/api/auth` | Login | `{email}` | User object or error (404) |\n| POST | `/api/auth` | Register | `{email, name}` | User object or error (409) |\n| GET | `/api/users/:id` | Get user | - | User object or error (404) |\n| PUT | `/api/users/:id` | Update profile | `{name?, bio?, phone?, avatar_url?}` | Updated user object |\n| POST | `/api/users/:id/become-host` | Become host | - | Updated user object |\n\n---\n\n### 11. Testing Infrastructure\n\n- **Test runner:** Playwright (`@playwright/test`)\n- **Test reporter:** Replay.io for debugging\n- **Test database:** Neon serverless Postgres (via environment variable `DATABASE_URL`)\n- **Dev server:** Netlify dev CLI serving functions on port 8888\n- **Test mode:** Sequential (1 worker, no parallel)\n\nThe auth system is fully tested through the test specification in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` with comprehensive coverage of validation, error handling, and happy path scenarios."}],"totalDurationMs":46895,"totalTokens":58987,"totalToolUseCount":33,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1204,"cache_read_input_tokens":55227,"output_tokens":2556,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1204},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
